<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[Hi {!Contact.FirstName},<br><br>It sounds like you’ve got some big plans for your business.&nbsp; Your preliminary small business financing application has been routed to me because it looks like there’s a good match between {!Account.Name} and National Funding.<a href="http://www.fivepointcapital.com/"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"></span></a><br><br><a href="http://www.nationalfunding.com/?utm_source=SF%20Emails&amp;utm_medium=Email&amp;utm_campaign=CallMe">National Funding</a>&nbsp;has several financing programs designed to help small businesses like {!Account.Name}.&nbsp; Our products don’t require impossible credit standards and most fund within a few days.&nbsp; By this time next week you could be:<br><div style="text-align: center;" align="left"><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;">Up-to-date on your outstanding invoices</span><br style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;">Negotiating your equipment purchase with cash in hand</span><br style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;">Planning your business remodel and expansion<br></span></div><p>To get a no-obligation quote, simply call me at {!User.Phone} between 6:30am and 4:30pm PST.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><br><span style="text-decoration: underline;">For faster service, fax the following information to my attention at {!User.Fax} and I can follow up with a full quote within 1 business day</span>:<br> </p><p>•   &nbsp;&nbsp; Your last&nbsp;6 months of&nbsp;your Business Bank Account statements <br>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Your last 4 months of merchant account statements (if your company accepts credit cards)</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The First page of your most recent Business Tax Return<br>•&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;Your signed and completed full application.<br><br>I'm looking forward to working with you.<br><br>Sincerely,<br>
<font size="4"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman,Times,Serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: bold;">{!User.Name}</span></font><br><br><font style="font-family: Arial,Sans-Serif; font-weight: bold;" size="4"><span style="font-style: italic;"></span></font><span style="font-family: Arial,Sans-Serif; font-weight: bold;"> </span>{!User.Name}<br>{!User.Title}<br><a href="http://www.nationalfunding.com/?utm_source=SF%20Emails&amp;utm_medium=Email&amp;utm_campaign=CallMe">www.nationalfunding.com</a><br>P: {!User.Phone} | F: {!User.Fax}<span sans-serif;\=""></span><br>Email: {!User.Email}<br><br><font color="#CC0000" size="1">Follow Us on: </font><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/national.funding"><img alt="" src="https://c.na6.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=01580000001WNEu&amp;oid=00D80000000diq5" align="left" border="0"></a><a href="http://www.linkedin.com/company/national-funding"><img alt="" src="https://c.na6.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=01580000001WNFn&amp;oid=00D80000000diq5" align="left" border="0"></a><a title="Twitter" href="http://twitter.com/NatFunding/" target="_blank" alt="Twitter"><img src="https://c.na6.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=01580000001WNFx&amp;oid=00D80000000diq5&amp;lastMod=1311017023000"></a>&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 7.5pt;"></span><a title="Google+" href="https://plus.google.com/+Nationalfunding/" target="_blank" alt="Google+" style="font-size: 12pt;"><img src="https://c.na6.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=01580000001Xf1W&amp;oid=00D80000000diq5&amp;lastMod=1363900191000"></a></p>]]></td>
